{
  "id": 391098809,
  "iid": 20201,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "rtcp: Fix erratic calculation of num_of_reported_pkts in RFC 8888 (as per Erratum ID 8166)",
  "description": "#### Fix erratic calculation of `num_of_reported_pkts` as per [Erratum ID 8166](https://www.rfc-editor.org/errata/eid8166) for [RFC 8888](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8888).\n\nThis MR is authored by my coworker Nico Cvitak (ncvitak@apple.com)\n\nThe code in epan/dissectors/packet-rtcp.c erratically calculates num_of_reported_pkts for \"the range begin_seq to begin_seq+num_reports inclusive\", when it should be for \"the range begin_seq up to, but not including, begin_seq+num_reports\".\n\n##### Before\n\n![40848d0c-ef1b-4160-9484-2afa0275a4e4.png](/uploads/c35d6c5663d6716df4ee34aa4a207345/40848d0c-ef1b-4160-9484-2afa0275a4e4.png)\n\n##### After\n\n![62027231-8f93-461c-abf4-a839593c99b2.png](/uploads/3650bce5bd27ecdc0fbde284e9dced75/62027231-8f93-461c-abf4-a839593c99b2.png)\n\n##### Test file\n\n[rtcp_rtpfb_ccfb.pcapng](/uploads/c4b23999b279a32295279b43025755bc/rtcp_rtpfb_ccfb.pcapng)",
  "state": "merged",
